Construct an ActionRequest for the policy engine (e.g., action "execute_artifact", resource = artifact_id, context includes the capabilities being used) and evaluate policies before execution. If the policy engine returns Deny (for example, maybe an execution requires consent or violates an isolation rule), abort and return an error.

